[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1323.909, "timestamp": "00:22:03", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1325.669, "timestamp": "00:22:05", "text": "それは問題にならないはずですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1328.39, "timestamp": "00:22:08", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1330.07, "timestamp": "00:22:10", "text": "うん。 確かに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1331.35, "timestamp": "00:22:11", "text": "問題にはなるだろうが、君にとっては問題ではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1333.11, "timestamp": "00:22:13", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1334.39, "timestamp": "00:22:14", "text": "はい。 他のすべての人にとって。   他の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1335.59, "timestamp": "00:22:15", "text": "誰かのために。   他のすべての人にとって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1338.71, "timestamp": "00:22:18", "text": "。 敵か、それとも味方か？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1341.51, "timestamp": "00:22:21", "text": "そして彼らは同盟国だ。 あなたがそれを試みた瞬間、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1342.549, "timestamp": "00:22:22", "text": "これは他の全員にとって問題となるでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1345.029, "timestamp": "00:22:25", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1345.83, "timestamp": "00:22:25", "text": "その通り。   何てことだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1348.71, "timestamp": "00:22:28", "text": "。 ようこそ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1349.669, "timestamp": "00:22:29", "text": "いらっしゃいませ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1351.99, "timestamp": "00:22:31", "text": "また、彼女には生き残るのに十分なHPがある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1354.149, "timestamp": "00:22:34", "text": "。 おそらく、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1358.86, "timestamp": "00:22:38", "text": "最大ダメージのファイアボールの一撃だけでも。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1359.99, "timestamp": "00:22:39", "text": "[音楽] そうだね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1361.43, "timestamp": "00:22:41", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1365.669, "timestamp": "00:22:45", "text": "しかし、あなたは2番目の生存可能な状況を生き延びることができるでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1367.83, "timestamp": "00:22:47", "text": "さて、問題は、その"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1372.31, "timestamp": "00:22:52", "text": "前に怒りによる3発の攻撃に耐えられるかどうかだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1374.87, "timestamp": "00:22:54", "text": "それもまた問題だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1379.59, "timestamp": "00:22:59", "text": "ああ、大変だ。"}]